<title>PORTUGAL: P.Telecom trade suspended for wrong order.</title>
<headline>P.Telecom trade suspended for wrong order.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Portugal Telecom was temporarily interrupted and orders placed at the pre-opening session cancelled because of a wrongly inserted order, dealers said.</p>
<p>The interruption was called when the stock was shown to have opened 801 escudos higher at 7,500 escudos.</p>
<p>($1=173.2 escudos)</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
